/* 说明用徽标触发：常驻小字会把表单堆成字墙，纯 title 又让触屏无解。
   ? 徽标 hover / focus 都能唤出气泡，占位只有一个字符宽。 */
.mvu-editor-label--with-hint {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 5px;
}

.mvu-editor-hint-badge {
  position: relative;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  width: 15px;
  height: 15px;
  padding: 0;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 1px solid rgba(120, 220, 255, 0.32);
  background: rgba(5, 20, 30, 0.7);
  color: rgba(184, 224, 240, 0.82);
  font-size: max(var(--dc-native-min-font, 0px), 10px);
  line-height: 1;
  cursor: help;
}

/* 顶层说明气泡：徽标外有多层 overflow-x:hidden，绝对定位一定被裁，
   因此挂到 body 用 fixed 定位，与项目既有的悬浮卡портal 做法一致。 */
.mvu-editor-hint-bubble {
  position: fixed;
  z-index: 10060;
  padding: 8px 11px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(120, 220, 255, 0.3);
  background: rgba(4, 16, 24, 0.98);
  color: rgba(229, 248, 255, 0.95);
  font-size: max(var(--dc-native-min-font, 0px), 12px);
  line-height: 1.55;
  text-align: left;
  white-space: normal;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.mvu-editor-hint-bubble[hidden] {
  display: none;
}

.mvu-editor-hint-badge:hover,
.mvu-editor-hint-badge:focus-visible {
  border-color: rgba(120, 220, 255, 0.7);
  color: #dff7ff;
}





.skill-designer-fixed-cost-chip {
  margin-left: 6px;
  font-size: max(var(--dc-native-min-font, 0px), 11px);
  color: rgba(76, 232, 240, 0.9);
